BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Eternal Song
DTSTART:20250603T020000Z
DTEND:20250603T035000Z
DTSTAMP:20250603T020000Z
UID:tJDURcTZGp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 87 mins (1h27m)\n\nPresented by Science and Nondual
 ity. The Eternal Song is a cinematic journey across Indigenous lands acros
 s the world. This film shares the stories of communities throughout genera
 tions to reveal both the deep scars of colonization and the healing power 
 of ancestral wisdom. Through their stories\, we are called to witness inte
 rgenerational trauma\, rediscover our kinship with the Earth\, and awaken 
 to a collective remembering—one that calls us back to belonging.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-eternal-song-film-premiere
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
