  landed what seems to be a dream job but she’s still stuck fetching coff
 ee\, until a chance meeting with her upstairs neighbor\, Lucy Berlinerr (A
 lly Sheedy). Lucy\, a once-celebrated photographer\, lives an enthralling 
 life with her drug-addicted German girlfriend\, (Patricia Clarkson)\, that
  draws Syd in. Before she can catch her breath\, Syd discovers dark truths
  of life on the edge\, is forced to confont the price of her hunger for re
 cognition and public esteem.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/hi
 gh-art
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
