UID:VHUSTyEX6k
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 127 mins (2h07m)\n\nPresented by 旦夕书店 AMOME
 NT BOOKS. 1994 年李安執導的喜劇劇情片。作為李安“家庭
 三部曲”的最后一部，講述了從傳統到現代的轉變。 1994
  comedy-drama film directed by Ang Lee. Part of Lee's "Father Knows Best" 
 trilogy\, this film deals with the transition from tradition to modernity.
 \n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/eat-drink-man-woman
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
